        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Stunning Family Home with Panoramic Countryside Views\n\nWe are delighted to present this exceptional detached bungalow residence located in the peaceful and scenic area of Tawnagh, Lahardane, Ballina, Co. Mayo. Extending to approximately 2,300 sq. ft., this beautifully maintained family home offers spacious accommodation, quality finishes throughout, and breathtaking panoramic views of Nephin Mountain and the surrounding countryside.\n\nSet on a private site with a maintenance-free driveway and block-built garage, this impressive property combines countryside tranquillity with convenient access to nearby towns and villages.\n\n\nAccommodation\nEntrance Hall\nCeramic tiled flooring\nFitted wardrobes with full-length mirrored doors providing excellent storage\nMaster Bedroom 15ft x 15ft\nLaminated flooring\nCurtains and picture windows\nTV point\nWall thermostat\nSpacious walk-in wardrobe with ceramic tiled flooring and shelving\nEn-Suite\nFloor-to-ceiling tiling\nElectric shower\nWC and wash hand basin\nVanity unit and mirror\nBedroom 2 12ft x 15ft\nFitted wardrobe\nCurtains on window\nTV point\nBedroom 3 18ft x 16ft\nLaminated flooring\nLarge picture window overlooking the surrounding countryside\nCurtains on window\nFitted wardrobe\nTV point\nMain Bathroom 12ft x 12ft\nCeramic tiled flooring\nFloor-to-ceiling tiling\nBath with overhead shower\nVanity unit and mirror\nBedroom 4 12ft x 14ft\nLaminated flooring\nCurtains on window\nTV Room 15ft x 16ft\nLaminated flooring\nCeramic tiled flooring feature area\nDouble doors leading to patio area\nTV point\nKitchen / Dining Room 20ft x 25ft\nCeramic tiled flooring\nBreakfast counter with granite worktop\nFully fitted kitchen with granite worktops\nIntegrated gas hob\nRecessed ceiling lighting\nIntegrated fridge freezer\nUtility Room 8ft x 6ft\nPlumbed for washing machine and dryer\nWorktop with sink\nAdditional storage press\nLocation\n\nThis beautiful home enjoys a peaceful countryside setting while remaining conveniently located:\n\nMinutes from Lahardane Village\nApprox. 20 minutes to Crossmolina\nApprox. 30 minutes to Ballina\nApprox. 30 minutes to Castlebar\n\nThe property benefits from spectacular scenery and a wonderful sense of privacy while still offering easy access to local amenities and services.\n\nLifestyle & Surroundings\n\nThe strategically positioned picture windows throughout the property ensure maximum enjoyment of the stunning countryside views and natural light. This is an ideal family residence for those seeking space, comfort, and tranquillity in one of Mayo's most scenic locations."
      },
